power that is at work within us,","from":3},{"book":"ISA","chapter":48,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":144,"source":"both","text":"You have heard these things; look at them all. Will you not acknowledge them? From now on I will tell you of new things, hidden things unknown to you.","from":3},{"book":"LUK","chapter":11,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":131,"source":"openbible","text":"So I tell you: Ask, and it will be given to you; seek, and you will find; knock, and the door will be opened to you.","from":3},{"book":"LUK","chapter":11,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":131,"source":"openbible","text":"For everyone who asks receives; he who seeks finds; and to him who knocks, the door will be opened.","from":3},{"book":"PSA","chapter":91,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":125,"source":"both","text":"When he calls out to Me, I will answer him; I will be with him in trouble. I will deliver him and honor him.","from":3},{"book":"DEU","chapter":4,"verse":29,"verseEnd":29,"votes":118,"source":"both","text":"But if from there you will seek the LORD your God, you will find Him if you seek Him with all your heart and with all your soul.","from":3}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]},"10-13":{"people":[{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"benjamin-h1144g","name":"Benjamin","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":13}],"places":[{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"negeb-h5045g","name":"Negeb","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"shephelah-h8219","name":"Shephelah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":13}],"words":[{"base":"H0369","lemma":"אַ֫יִן","tr":"a·yin","gloss":"nothing","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":788},{"base":"H5892","lemma":"עִיר","tr":"ir","gloss":"excitement","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":1090},{"base":"H6963","lemma":"ק